                            <comment id="15190624" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 11 Mar 2016 08:08:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2799&quot; title=&quot;Coordinator floods network with partitions&amp;#39; full map messages&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-2799&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-2799&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15203937" author="avinogradov" created="Mon, 21 Mar 2016 09:28:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reproduced. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Started 10 nodes with 35 caches. &lt;br/&gt;
Gained 37 MB of GridDhtPartitionsFullMessage per minute -&amp;gt; 49 Mb/s&lt;br/&gt;
Rough multiplication to 30 nodes &amp;amp; 65 caches (x6) gives exactly 300Mb/s &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15204377" author="avinogradov" created="Mon, 21 Mar 2016 14:49:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Removal of refreshPartitions(timeout); at org/apache/ignite/internal/processors/cache/GridCachePartitionExchangeManager.java:1270 &lt;br/&gt;
solves problem by turning off redundand background exchange.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Am I missed something?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15204385" author="dmagda" created="Mon, 21 Mar 2016 14:52:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Quite weird place. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sboikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sboikov&quot;&gt;sboikov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; please comment on why do we need this stuff at line 1270&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15217690" author="avinogradov" created="Wed, 30 Mar 2016 09:00:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
